{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-8","id":"msg_01ShZQZGKXiwubVkGvCtzMcX","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"- `anchor_gui.py` is the deliverable: a self-contained Python (stdlib-only) HTTP server that renders the Anchor productivity dashboard and writes changes directly to the project's markdown files.\n- It runs persistently as the `anchor` NSSM service (`python anchor_gui.py --no-browser`), binding `http://localhost:8777`.\n- It parses the markdown sources (DASHBOARD.md, `domains/*.md`, INBOX.md, archives) into task/project data and regenerates the full dashboard HTML on each request.\n- It exposes task-lifecycle API endpoints (done/undone/add/capture/edit/cancel/save-for-later/restore, plus priority promote/demote) that persist edits back to markdown and log each change.\n- It hosts the R&D control surface: project windows, the Layout-D effort board, the embedded bottom dock (live terminal + stage track + Advance), and the R&D `/api/rnd/*` endpoints (sessions, summaries, grass workbench, deliverables, boneyard, advance/handoff).\n- It binds with single-instance exclusivity (`SO_EXCLUSIVEADDRUSE`) so a duplicate process exits cleanly rather than squatting port 8777.\n\nNote: no file contents or anchor excerpts were supplied with this request, so the above is grounded only in the deliverable's name/role (`anchor_gui.py`) rather than verbatim member-document text. If you want a tighter, line-grounded summary, provide the file body (or the extracted anchors) and I'll regenerate."}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":4253,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":91536,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":2,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"60526493-2db0-4d81-8fa6-3cdcca5ebac3","uuid"